## Tools Used

**Assembler:** sjasmplus
```bash
sjasmplus --raw=example-1.bin example-1.asm
```

**TAP Converter:** bin2tap.py
```bash
python3 bin2tap.py example-1.bin example-1.tap 0x8000
```

**Emulator:** FUSE
```bash
fuse --tape example-1.tap --auto-load
```

**Validator:** validate-z80-asm.py
```bash
python3 /scripts/validate-z80-asm.py example-1.asm
```

All lesson files available in: `/code-samples/sinclair-zx-spectrum/phase-1/tier-1/lesson-003/`

